    "featured_accordion_tDiBLC": {
      "type": "featured-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "entry_q7pMtc": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "How does it work?",
            "text": "<p>The LawnMaster L10 is a robotic lawnmower that will mow your lawn independently, freeing you up to either relax or get stuff done while the lawn is taken care of. The robot mower will alternately mow and charge, returning automatically to the charging dock when the battery is low. The mower is contained within the lawn by a boundary wire which is connected to the charging station. The charging station sends a safe, low voltage signal along the boundary wire which the mower senses and won’t go past. The boundary wire should be laid around the area that is to be mowed and can be used to exclude the mower from certain areas and obstacles, such as trees, shrubs, raised beds and ponds.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
            "product_specifications": "",
            "html": "",
            "collection": "",
            "collection_products_per_page": 8,
            "products": [],
            "image_loading": "",
            "video_1": "",
            "video_2": ""
          }
        },
        "entry_frmLHx": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Is installation easy?",
            "text": "<p>Installation requires a boundary wire to be laid around the perimeter of the cutting area and connected to a charging station. This is simple but may take some time. However, the time spent setting up is one-time only, and is repaid by many hours of effort-free lawn maintenance!</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
            "product_specifications": "",
            "html": "",
            "collection": "",
            "collection_products_per_page": 8,
            "products": [],
